		"Id": "mechdef_stalker_STK-3T",
		"Name": "Stalker",
		"Details": "With the Trinity Alliance's development of the Heavy and Light Plasma Rifles, the allied governments of the Alliance began distributing them to their military-industrial complexes. The Taurian Concordat ended up with the lion's share of the Heavy Plasma Rifles and put them on a series of refit designs meant to showcase the new weapon's potental. Among those designs was the Stalker STK-3T. Armed with twin Heavy Plasma Rifles for primary armaments, the -3T backs up the rifles with two LRM-10s for indirect capability and four Medium Lasers to lance anything that gets too close for comfort. Each Rifle has two tons of ammo to call upon, which was deemed sufficient for most battlefield encounters. The STK-3T proved itself a success and saw regular deployment with TDF regiments.",
		"Icon": "uixTxrIcon_stalker"
	},
